    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/7d59cf59b1389fa8a4dabed882675501.poster.avif?t=1717471263\" width=600 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/7d59cf59b1389fa8a4dabed882675501.webm?t=1717471263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/7d59cf59b1389fa8a4dabed882675501.mp4?t=1717471263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/86fa9c3ffa23c2cfeba7b2044d0a283e.avif?t=1717471263\" width=600 height=67 /></span><br>Craft a garden that produces cards for your deck. Carefully cultivate your garden by strategically planning what plants to grow when and where. Utilize plant adjacency, garden tools, and set bonuses to grow an efficient deck.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/28b3c94d4db02cf2072fa5a3633b1d71.poster.avif?t=1717471263\" width=584 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/28b3c94d4db02cf2072fa5a3633b1d71.webm?t=1717471263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/28b3c94d4db02cf2072fa5a3633b1d71.mp4?t=1717471263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >When the stars align</h2>Every card adds power to your constellation. Cards you play when high power stars are lit have <strong>double their effect</strong>. If you plan wisely, you can turn any battle around.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/78ae068f52c7998ff51f4a0ec53d0231.poster.avif?t=1717471263\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/78ae068f52c7998ff51f4a0ec53d0231.webm?t=1717471263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/78ae068f52c7998ff51f4a0ec53d0231.mp4?t=1717471263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What will your plants grow into?</h2>Depending on how you care for your plants, they can <strong>grow into different variations</strong>. Discover what your plants can become and unlock their full potential.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/f186aa447772e14f77d70da6ba6bc2c7.poster.avif?t=1717471263\" width=600 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/f186aa447772e14f77d70da6ba6bc2c7.webm?t=1717471263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/f186aa447772e14f77d70da6ba6bc2c7.mp4?t=1717471263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Changing times, changing deck</h2>As the plants in your garden grow and die, manage the <strong>changing permutations</strong> of your deck. Will you organize your garden to max out its strength or its life? Play creatively around what plants are in your garden.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/98646282e892ddb84c184867fba00378.poster.avif?t=1717471263\" width=600 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/98646282e892ddb84c184867fba00378.webm?t=1717471263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/98646282e892ddb84c184867fba00378.mp4?t=1717471263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Heartfelt narrative</h2>Play as Luna as she fights seasonal depression and her fears of the city to leave the house. You will face manifestations of Luna's fears, as you journey through the Caged City. Don\u2019t let them stop you from finding your courage and peace in the concrete.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/7d59cf59b1389fa8a4dabed882675501.poster.avif?t=1717471263\" width=600 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/7d59cf59b1389fa8a4dabed882675501.webm?t=1717471263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/7d59cf59b1389fa8a4dabed882675501.mp4?t=1717471263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/86fa9c3ffa23c2cfeba7b2044d0a283e.avif?t=1717471263\" width=600 height=67 /></span><br>Craft a garden that produces cards for your deck. Carefully cultivate your garden by strategically planning what plants to grow when and where. Utilize plant adjacency, garden tools, and set bonuses to grow an efficient deck.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/28b3c94d4db02cf2072fa5a3633b1d71.poster.avif?t=1717471263\" width=584 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/28b3c94d4db02cf2072fa5a3633b1d71.webm?t=1717471263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/28b3c94d4db02cf2072fa5a3633b1d71.mp4?t=1717471263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >When the stars align</h2>Every card adds power to your constellation. Cards you play when high power stars are lit have <strong>double their effect</strong>. If you plan wisely, you can turn any battle around.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/78ae068f52c7998ff51f4a0ec53d0231.poster.avif?t=1717471263\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/78ae068f52c7998ff51f4a0ec53d0231.webm?t=1717471263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/78ae068f52c7998ff51f4a0ec53d0231.mp4?t=1717471263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What will your plants grow into?</h2>Depending on how you care for your plants, they can <strong>grow into different variations</strong>. Discover what your plants can become and unlock their full potential.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/f186aa447772e14f77d70da6ba6bc2c7.poster.avif?t=1717471263\" width=600 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/f186aa447772e14f77d70da6ba6bc2c7.webm?t=1717471263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/f186aa447772e14f77d70da6ba6bc2c7.mp4?t=1717471263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Changing times, changing deck</h2>As the plants in your garden grow and die, manage the <strong>changing permutations</strong> of your deck. Will you organize your garden to max out its strength or its life? Play creatively around what plants are in your garden.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/98646282e892ddb84c184867fba00378.poster.avif?t=1717471263\" width=600 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/98646282e892ddb84c184867fba00378.webm?t=1717471263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595120/extras/98646282e892ddb84c184867fba00378.mp4?t=1717471263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Heartfelt narrative</h2>Play as Luna as she fights seasonal depression and her fears of the city to leave the house. You will face manifestations of Luna's fears, as you journey through the Caged City. Don\u2019t let them stop you from finding your courage and peace in the concrete.",
